            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Here's the patch!  BTW, I'll edit the docs as soon as someone signs off that this is a good idea!",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=fizx",
            "name": "fizx",
            "key": "fizx",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Kyle Maxwell",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2007-10-05T01:06:50.776+0000",
          "updated": "2007-10-05T01:08:11.492+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12379723/comment/12532560",
          "id": "12532560",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=hossman",
            "name": "hossman",
            "key": "hossman",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=hossman&avatarId=21247",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=hossman&avatarId=21247",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=hossman&avatarId=21247",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=hossman&avatarId=21247"
            },
            "displayName": "Chris M. Hostetter",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Phoenix"
          },
          "body": "this class seems to assume that the ValueSourceQueries should be multipled ... but it would be just as easy to assume the should be added, or averaged.\n\nIt seems like it might make more sense if instead of a CustomMultiScoreQuery there was just a \"ProductValueSource\" class that took in a ValueSource[] and multiplied them",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=hossman",
            "name": "hossman",
            "key": "hossman",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=hossman&avatarId=21247",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=hossman&avatarId=21247",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=hossman&avatarId=21247",
